## Checklist Items (Stable Identity)

```typescript
// Static checklist (decorative)
interface ChecklistItem {
  id: string;
  text: string;
  checked: boolean;  // Default state shown in editor
}

// Portal interactive checklist
interface PortalChecklistItem {
  id: string;
  text: string;
  // Checked state stored SEPARATELY in portal_checklist_states table
  // Keyed by: portal_id + element_id + item_id + member_id
}
```

### New Table for Portal Checklist State

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS portal_checklist_states (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  portal_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
  element_id TEXT NOT NULL,
  item_id TEXT NOT NULL,
  member_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
  checked INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  updated_at TEXT DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  UNIQUE(portal_id, element_id, item_id, member_id)
);
```

