## Renderer Logic

```typescript
// Blog post rendering
if (post.editorType === "canvas" && post.layoutJson) {
  return <CanvasRenderer document={JSON.parse(post.layoutJson)} />;
} else {
  return <TipTapRenderer content={post.content} />;
}

// Review/Guide rendering (always canvas)
if (review.layoutJson) {
  return <CanvasRenderer document={JSON.parse(review.layoutJson)} />;
}
```

